lib/app_attest/root_certificate.ex

Apple's own "Apple App Attestation Root CA" certificate is compiled in as
public data, published by Apple at
https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/Apple_App_Attestation_Root_CA.pem,
and cross-checked byte-for-byte against the copies bundled with
takimoto3/app-attest and uebelack/node-app-attest above.

Apple's own "Apple Root CA - G3" certificate (#171, the root an App Attest
receipt's own signature chains to) is compiled in the same way, published
by Apple at
https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/AppleRootCA-G3.cer, and
cross-checked byte-for-byte against the copy bundled with
takimoto3/app-attest's own fraud/receipt/testdata/AppleRootCA-G3.cer.
